    "Couldn't check your screen lock delay (%@). Set “Require password after sleep” to “Immediately” in System Settings → Lock Screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر فحص مهلة قفل الشاشة (%@). اضبط «طلب كلمة المرور بعد السكون» على «فورًا» في إعدادات النظام ← قفل الشاشة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't determine your screen lock delay. Set “Require password after sleep” to “Immediately” in System Settings → Lock Screen.": {
